WEBVTT

00:08.770 --> 00:15.380
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.380 --> 00:18.710
<b>I just reached my hand out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.020
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:27.460
<b>No matter what I get, I won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.660 --> 00:34.600
<b>Escape from the gaps in your
tangled up heart</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:36.670
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:41.900
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.900 --> 00:44.940
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.210
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.810
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.480
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.300
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.300 --> 01:16.400
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.400 --> 01:19.640
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.210
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:25.870
<b>Right away</b>

02:30.610 --> 02:32.880
<b>Damn!</b>

03:01.110 --> 03:03.480
<b>You're kidding, right?</b>

03:03.480 --> 03:07.520
<b>Talk about unreasonable.
We have to stop this guy?</b>

03:07.520 --> 03:10.350
<b>He hasn't even done anything.</b>

03:10.350 --> 03:13.120
<b>And we can already feel his strength!</b>

03:13.120 --> 03:16.580
<b>Say your prayers! I'm abandoning
my godhood!</b>

03:57.130 --> 03:59.830
<b>It was a dark, empty world.</b>

04:00.840 --> 04:02.630
<b>This was where I grew up.</b>

04:03.610 --> 04:06.140
<b>So, I never had cause to hate anyone.</b>

04:06.140 --> 04:10.100
<b>My solitude was natural. My lack of
freedom was a matter of course.</b>

04:13.150 --> 04:17.450
<b>But for some reason, my heart was cold.</b>

04:17.450 --> 04:21.510
<b>Was that because of the laughter I could
hear from somewhere?</b>

04:22.490 --> 04:25.690
<b>Or because of the bit of faint light
that was leaking in?</b>

04:28.360 --> 04:30.350
<b>Of a lineage related to the Jade Emperor?</b>

04:31.400 --> 04:34.890
<b>Why has a guy like that been
shut up in this place?</b>

04:35.700 --> 04:37.410
<b>Well, according to the rumors,</b>

04:37.410 --> 04:40.540
<b>his father's supposed to be a
human from the Lower World.</b>

04:40.540 --> 04:45.150
<b>Then, isn't he going to die eventually?</b>

04:45.150 --> 04:49.020
<b>Yeah, this is just my personal speculation,</b>

04:49.020 --> 04:52.950
<b>but I think the Jade Emperor might
actually be waiting for that.</b>

04:52.950 --> 04:56.250
<b>I see. So, I'm going to die someday.</b>

04:57.960 --> 04:59.890
<b>That won't be so bad either.</b>

04:59.890 --> 05:04.890
<b>I don't feel alive being the
way I am now anyway.</b>

05:20.320 --> 05:21.780
<b>Out!</b>

05:42.500 --> 05:44.170
<b>Homura!</b>

05:44.170 --> 05:46.940
<b>I shall bestow freedom upon you.</b>

05:48.180 --> 05:51.740
<b>Right then, I heard his voice clearly.</b>

05:52.810 --> 05:54.810
<b>"How long do you intend to live?"</b>

06:05.760 --> 06:07.230
<b>The outside world...</b>

06:08.000 --> 06:10.290
<b>The Heavens were overflowing with light.</b>

06:13.000 --> 06:15.900
<b>But it couldn't erase my sense of guilt.</b>

06:17.240 --> 06:20.170
<b>Being outside the prison didn't
change my solitude.</b>

06:21.440 --> 06:24.970
<b>Without a purpose to live for,
freedom was meaningless.</b>

06:26.250 --> 06:29.950
<b>The tranquil, boring days that
were almost hateful to me</b>

06:29.950 --> 06:32.440
<b>just went by emptily.</b>

06:36.830 --> 06:38.290
<b>It's the same.</b>

06:39.690 --> 06:41.250
<b>Nothing has changed.</b>

06:42.600 --> 06:44.830
<b>I'm still no different than being dead.</b>

06:49.140 --> 06:50.600
<b>Please pardon me!</b>

06:51.910 --> 06:53.640
<b>I'm really sorry.</b>

06:54.640 --> 06:57.770
<b>Why do you apologize to someone like me?</b>

06:58.410 --> 07:01.780
<b>Because it was my fault.</b>

07:01.780 --> 07:05.080
<b>Fault? Does that mean you're
guilty of a crime?</b>

07:05.790 --> 07:08.980
<b>I don't think it's anything so serious.</b>

07:13.030 --> 07:16.930
<b>That is, I'm sorry. That is, yes.</b>

07:17.630 --> 07:20.760
<b>I think it was my crime.</b>

07:25.040 --> 07:28.670
<b>Did I commit some crime?</b>

07:42.290 --> 07:45.460
<b>So, you know, I had a thought.</b>

07:45.460 --> 07:49.360
<b>It was a wish that I could stay
with you forever, Homura.</b>

07:51.270 --> 07:52.730
<b>Homura?</b>

07:53.330 --> 07:54.820
<b>Is there a future for me?</b>

07:56.840 --> 08:01.430
<b>I'm sorry. I've hurt you again, haven't I?</b>

08:02.910 --> 08:06.400
<b>But you know, if you died, I'd die too.</b>

08:07.250 --> 08:11.410
<b>I might not be able to die,
but I promise, I'll die!</b>

08:13.520 --> 08:17.320
<b>Don't worry, Rinrei. I won't die.</b>

08:23.630 --> 08:25.500
<b>I want to stay alive.</b>

08:25.500 --> 08:26.970
<b>I thought so for the first time.</b>

08:28.070 --> 08:30.470
<b>So I wouldn't bring sorrow to the one I loved.</b>

08:31.470 --> 08:33.240
<b>So I could protect the one I loved.</b>

08:34.640 --> 08:36.110
<b>I came to want a future.</b>

08:50.090 --> 08:51.490
<b>Dokugaku!
Dokugakuji!</b>

08:51.490 --> 08:52.960
<b>Damn it!</b>

08:53.530 --> 08:57.400
<b>Give it up! You guys don't stand a chance!</b>

08:57.400 --> 09:00.100
<b>Troublesome doesn't come
close to describing him.</b>

09:00.100 --> 09:02.340
<b>The difference between our
strengths is too great!</b>

09:02.340 --> 09:06.340
<b>Hakkai, how about taking advantage
of our superior numbers?</b>

09:06.340 --> 09:10.750
<b>Yes, after all, that's pretty much
all we have going for us.</b>

09:10.750 --> 09:13.480
<b>We'll distract him.</b>

09:13.480 --> 09:16.450
<b>And we'll do something about
him while you do that.</b>

09:16.450 --> 09:18.050
<b>Yes!</b>

09:18.050 --> 09:20.220
<b>Dokugakuji! Lady Lirin!</b>

09:20.220 --> 09:21.860
<b>I heard you!</b>

09:21.860 --> 09:23.360
<b>Roger that.</b>

09:23.360 --> 09:24.790
<b>Hey, Dokugaku!</b>

09:25.660 --> 09:27.890
<b>I'm fine. I'm still good to go.</b>

09:30.160 --> 09:32.390
<b>All right then, everyone! Here we go!</b>

09:55.520 --> 09:56.990
<b>You stupid monkey!</b>

10:06.030 --> 10:07.500
<b>No!</b>

10:11.070 --> 10:12.540
<b>Bastard!</b>

10:14.240 --> 10:15.710
<b>Don't underestimate me!</b>

10:18.780 --> 10:20.250
<b>Damn you!</b>

10:33.830 --> 10:35.760
<b>Do it.</b>

10:35.760 --> 10:37.250
<b>Die.</b>

10:42.900 --> 10:44.440
<b>Hold it!</b>

10:44.440 --> 10:47.070
<b>We won't allow you to do as you please!</b>

11:18.740 --> 11:21.000
<b>So, you intend to settle this
in the next attack?</b>

11:24.080 --> 11:25.550
<b>Fine, then.</b>

11:26.680 --> 11:28.340
<b>Come, you stupid monkey!</b>

11:45.800 --> 11:48.540
<b>Wow! It's so shiny!</b>

11:48.540 --> 11:50.270
<b>It's like the sun!</b>

11:50.270 --> 11:54.610
<b>Will you be able to continue
to be that little runt's sun?</b>

11:58.680 --> 12:00.650
<b>You damn stupid monkey!</b>

12:27.140 --> 12:28.800
<b>There was something I wanted to protect.</b>

12:29.980 --> 12:34.350
<b>When I lost it, I learned for the first
time how worthless I was.</b>

12:35.520 --> 12:38.180
<b>I learned I had my hands full
just looking after myself.</b>

12:40.050 --> 12:41.520
<b>And then I wished...</b>

12:42.490 --> 12:45.080
<b>...to have things I wouldn't have to protect.</b>

12:47.500 --> 12:50.120
<b>You moron, don't take it so seriously.</b>

12:52.500 --> 12:56.970
<b>If this place had been deep within the earth,</b>

12:56.970 --> 12:59.500
<b>I wouldn't have yearned for the sun.</b>

13:01.710 --> 13:05.250
<b>If this place had been deep within the earth,</b>

13:05.250 --> 13:08.180
<b>I'd never have had to know what
freedom and Ioneliness were.</b>

13:14.260 --> 13:15.720
<b>I can hear a voice.</b>

13:16.520 --> 13:17.990
<b>Whose voice could it be?</b>

13:18.760 --> 13:22.290
<b>It's so familiar and always with me.</b>

13:24.030 --> 13:25.500
<b>And it's so shiny.</b>

13:26.030 --> 13:31.230
<b>I feel like this voice belongs to
someone I should never forget.</b>

13:32.910 --> 13:34.880
<b>Hey, hey, Sanzo!</b>

13:34.880 --> 13:36.430
<b>Knock it off!</b>

13:41.680 --> 13:43.150
<b>From a long time ago...</b>

13:46.150 --> 13:48.140
<b>What the hell'd you do that for,
you stupid monkey?!</b>

13:52.330 --> 13:56.200
<b>What do you think?! Hurry up
and go change!</b>

13:56.200 --> 13:58.100
<b>Quit grumbling, or I'm leaving you behind!</b>

13:58.830 --> 14:00.330
<b>This voice...</b>

14:00.330 --> 14:01.570
<b>Who is it?</b>

14:01.570 --> 14:01.840
<b>That's enough!
Who is it?</b>

14:01.840 --> 14:03.700
<b>That's enough!</b>

14:03.700 --> 14:06.240
<b>I TOLD you not to drink it!</b>

14:06.240 --> 14:07.510
<b>What?</b>

14:07.510 --> 14:07.740
<b>What the hell did you tell this stupid monkey?
What?</b>

14:07.740 --> 14:10.440
<b>What the hell did you tell this stupid monkey?</b>

14:10.440 --> 14:11.910
<b>This voice...</b>

14:24.460 --> 14:26.520
<b>Oh, it's Sanzo.</b>

14:38.170 --> 14:40.300
<b>Man, I'm hungry!</b>

14:41.640 --> 14:43.110
<b>You stupid monkey!</b>

14:44.210 --> 14:46.340
<b>Ow! What the hell'd you do that for?!</b>

14:52.650 --> 14:54.620
<b>Sanzo, thank you!</b>

14:56.260 --> 14:58.230
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

14:58.230 --> 15:00.350
<b>I heard your voice.</b>

15:01.760 --> 15:05.100
<b>Stupid monkey, I never called to you.</b>

15:13.570 --> 15:16.200
<b>How long are you going to sit there?</b>

15:18.010 --> 15:21.740
<b>Let's go. He's in there.</b>

15:51.280 --> 15:53.010
<b>Why do you stand back up again?</b>

15:53.950 --> 15:56.350
<b>The fight's already over.</b>

15:57.220 --> 16:03.790
<b>Sorry, but see, we decided we
wouldn't run a long, long time ago.</b>

16:03.790 --> 16:08.460
<b>And so, you'll have to keep us company
for a little while longer.</b>

16:10.830 --> 16:14.320
<b>I don't chant sutras for the dead.</b>

16:15.540 --> 16:17.540
<b>The gods don't save anyone.</b>

16:17.540 --> 16:20.340
<b>You're the only one who can save yourself.</b>

16:20.340 --> 16:22.440
<b>You could escape.</b>

16:22.440 --> 16:24.980
<b>Your death will change nothing.</b>

16:24.980 --> 16:28.970
<b>But there are some things that will
change, if you're alive.</b>

16:29.750 --> 16:32.240
<b>Yes, just a little longer!</b>

16:33.290 --> 16:35.590
<b>Here we go, Mister!</b>

16:37.690 --> 16:41.420
<b>I'm gonna settle this soon. After all, we...</b>

16:50.970 --> 16:53.110
<b>What the heck's going on?</b>

16:53.110 --> 16:58.640
<b>He's probably become unable to
control the growing power.</b>

16:59.280 --> 17:00.780
<b>That means...</b>

17:00.780 --> 17:02.210
<b>Yes.</b>

17:04.590 --> 17:07.720
<b>Sorry, but don't hold it against us!</b>

17:07.720 --> 17:10.160
<b>Necessity knows no law, after all.</b>

17:23.540 --> 17:25.470
<b>This is the end!</b>

17:32.280 --> 17:33.750
<b>Mirei!</b>

17:48.560 --> 17:51.360
<b>Homura, I'll be going on ahead.</b>

17:55.970 --> 17:57.440
<b>Mirei...</b>

18:28.200 --> 18:31.930
<b>This place, I feel like I've seen it before.</b>

18:32.740 --> 18:36.700
<b>There's something familiar
about those mountains.</b>

18:37.880 --> 18:39.350
<b>I wonder where I've seen it?</b>

18:40.150 --> 18:41.610
<b>So, that's it?</b>

18:53.430 --> 18:55.100
<b>You're here.</b>

18:55.100 --> 18:56.560
<b>Sorry for the wait.</b>

18:57.930 --> 19:02.560
<b>Hey, Homura! I'll never accept this place!</b>

19:04.100 --> 19:05.570
<b>I'll bet.</b>

19:07.340 --> 19:10.810
<b>Is this your new Heaven and Earth?</b>

19:10.810 --> 19:12.580
<b>That's right.</b>

19:12.580 --> 19:15.580
<b>Eventually, this place will swallow
up the old Heaven and Earth</b>

19:15.580 --> 19:17.570
<b>that has existed until now.</b>

19:23.060 --> 19:24.590
<b>That boulder...</b>

19:24.590 --> 19:26.860
<b>It's just as you've surmised.</b>

19:26.860 --> 19:30.930
<b>When that boulder reaches its
critical point and shatters,</b>

19:30.930 --> 19:33.230
<b>the new Heaven and Earth will be complete.</b>

19:33.230 --> 19:35.200
<b>Don't be ridiculous!</b>

19:35.200 --> 19:39.610
<b>Do you think we'll just twiddle
our thumbs and watch?</b>

19:39.610 --> 19:41.800
<b>We won't let you have your way!</b>

19:42.380 --> 19:46.050
<b>Why not? What don't you like about this?</b>

19:46.050 --> 19:48.740
<b>What's so displeasing about this world?</b>

19:49.950 --> 19:53.990
<b>I don't like it, not any of it.</b>

19:53.990 --> 19:59.260
<b>Surely, it isn't as if you favor that old world.</b>

19:59.260 --> 20:03.530
<b>No, that other world's full of
things that piss me off too.</b>

20:04.270 --> 20:08.260
<b>Hey, Homura! Come on! Let's settle this!</b>

20:09.470 --> 20:15.040
<b>You're merely living there.
Can you defeat me?</b>

20:15.040 --> 20:17.850
<b>Clinging to your tiny souls...</b>

20:17.850 --> 20:20.140
<b>Just how much could it possibly
be worth to you?</b>

20:23.180 --> 20:24.650
<b>Fine.</b>

20:29.160 --> 20:30.620
<b>Then come!</b>

20:46.940 --> 20:55.750
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:57.120 --> 21:07.520
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.860 --> 21:19.000
<b>Emotions like the sand spilling
out of my hands</b>

21:20.340 --> 21:33.320
<b>The words that pierced my heart back
then suddenly ache</b>

21:33.320 --> 21:44.770
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.770 --> 21:56.040
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:56.040 --> 22:08.220
<b>Now, I can surely walk on and on forever</b>
